    {
      "title": "Claims lodgement portal — requirements sign-off",
      "description": "Turning the rework findings into a release 1 backlog: 12 requirements traced to their source, a 50-day build budget, and one disputed requirement to settle at sign-off.",
      "dueInDays": 3,
      "brief": "## Claims lodgement portal — release 1 requirements\n\n**Sponsor** Helena, GM Claims · **Delivery lead** Arjun · **Sign-off meeting** @+3d\n**Build budget** 50 days for release 1\n**Goal** rework from 31% to under 15% within three months of go-live\n\n### Where it stands\nTwelve requirements, seven agreed. Must and Should together come to **46 days**, inside the budget with four to spare. Live chat (7 days) doesn't fit unless REQ-05, REQ-07 or REQ-08 drops — losing REQ-06 alone frees only two days. Fraud scoring is agreed as a Won't for this release.\n\n### Traceability\nEvery Must traces to a rework cause from the current-state findings or to a compliance obligation. Nothing is in because someone asked loudly. The three biggest causes in the 200 coded claims — missing photos (58), policy number mismatch (41) and wrong claim type (33) — are answered by REQ-02, REQ-01 and REQ-03.\n\n### To settle at sign-off\n- **REQ-06 bank details at lodgement** — triage wants them up front to pay faster; compliance wants them collected only at settlement, when they are actually needed (APP 3). Disputed\n- **REQ-02 photo threshold** — $1,000 or $500?\n- **REQ-03 guided claim type** — triage still reviewing the question flow\n- **REQ-09 phone-assisted lodgement** — the phone team hasn't seen the screens yet",
      "callout": {
        "title": "46 of 50 build days committed",
        "body": "Must (29 days) + Should (17 days) = 46. The four days left cover estimate risk, not new scope. Live chat stays a Could unless Helena drops REQ-05, REQ-07 or REQ-08 at sign-off.",
        "accent": "#6366f1",
        "icon": "📐"
      },
